  },
  {
    "id": 2017019010100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、どうだったっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701901/2017019010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、打ち合わせは上手くいったよ\r\n収録は最後の方しか観れなかったけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017019010110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あ。待ってほしいっす\r\n手帳に書くっす",
    "charAnim1": "surp4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701901/2017019010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017019010120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "わたしの手帳、持ってるっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701901/2017019010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、持ってるよ\r\nはい、これ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0885",
    "autoWaitTime": 1600
  },
  {
    "id": 2017019010130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ありがとっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701901/2017019010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組ディレクター",
    "text": "はは。あさひちゃん熱心だね\r\n今日の収録の振り返り？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017019010140,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "？　違うっすよ\r\nプロデューサーさんを観察してるっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701901/2017019010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組ディレクター",
    "text": "えっ、そうなの？\r\nどうして？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……普通はそういう反応になるよな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実は、今度芹沢がドラマに出演することが\r\n決まりまして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組ディレクター",
    "text": "ああ！　この前制作発表見たよ\r\n人気漫画が原作のラブコメだよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい。それで役作りの一環で……",
